I arrive at the office.
I open the big glass door.
I walk inside.
The office is very cool.
The AC is running.
My colleagues are here.
They are sitting at their desks.
Some people are talking.
I see my colleague Prakash.
Prakash is looking at the computer.
"Good morning Maya," Prakash says.
I smile.
"Good morning," I reply.
I say good morning to everyone.
I walk to my seat.
I put the bag on the table.
I sit in my chair.
I turn on the computer.
I am starting my work now.
